<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Bruce Lee returns a month after the epilepsy clinic. He has had no further events, staring spells or jerks on waking. He sleeps about seven hours a night, eats three meals a day, and the studio now keeps the air conditioning on between takes and gives breaks every hour. He drinks when thirsty and has salty snacks and an electrolyte drink during long training sessions in the heat, rather than forcing large amounts of water. He has used no cannabis and has not driven; a studio driver takes him to work. His back pain is better with the core program he began with a physical therapist three weeks ago, 3 out of 10, and he uses acetaminophen once or twice a week. The repeat blood test planned for about a week after the epilepsy clinic did not happen: he was away for work and no laboratory visit was booked for it. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Events</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About seven hours a night</td></tr><tr><td>Heat and fluids</td><td>Air conditioning and hourly breaks at the studio; drinks to thirst with electrolytes</td></tr><tr><td>Cannabis and driving</td><td>None since the seizure</td></tr><tr><td>Back pain</td><td>3 out of 10 with the core program</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

